sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Row as Sidebar extra row
    participant Store as WorkbenchSidebarStore
    participant Api as window.__omnimuxWorkbench
    participant Mem as FocusMemory localStorage
    participant BS as dsh-better-sidebar
    participant Tab as Library/Canvas Tab
    participant Toggle as data-omnimux-chat-toggle
    participant Conv as official conversation

    User->>Row: 点「资产库」
    Row->>Store: open()
    Store->>Api: open({ tabId: omnimux-assets:library })
    Api->>Api: closeDetails(); releaseCurrentProductStage()
    alt 无 better-sidebar
        Api-->>Store: false（禁止 overlay 回退）
    else 无当前会话
        Api-->>User: false + 「请先新建或打开一个会话」
    else 正常
        Api->>BS: wait snapshot(sessionId)
        Api->>BS: closeSeedFiles(); openTab(library)
        Api->>Mem: read(sessionId, tabId)
        alt 有手切记录
            Api->>BS: setFocus(remembered.mode, remembered.splitWidth)
        else 无记录
            Api->>Api: resolveDefaultFocus → gui
            Api->>BS: setFocus(gui) 不落盘
        end
        Api->>Tab: visible; attachStore
        Tab-->>User: 右栏资产页（填满容器）
        Conv-->>User: 仍挂载；gui 时被挤到可视宽≈0
        Note over Conv: data-dsh-product-stage 为空
    end

    User->>Toggle: 展开对话
    Toggle->>Api: setFocus(split, persist=true)
    Api->>Mem: write(S1, assets, {mode:split, splitWidth})
    Api->>BS: width = splitWidth || default(~420 会话)
    Conv-->>User: 中间对话可见

    User->>Row: 点「视频剪辑」
    Row->>Api: open({ tabId: omnimux-clip:studio })
    Api->>Mem: read(S1, clip) 空
    Api->>Api: default = gui（不继承资产 split）
    Api->>BS: setFocus(gui) 不落盘
    Note over Tab: 资产 Tab 可仍挂着（single 防重复；跨 type 共存）

    User->>Row: 再点「资产库」
    Api->>Mem: read(S1, assets) → split
    Api->>BS: 恢复 split

    User->>Tab: 点库页 Close
    Tab->>Api: closeTab(assets)
    Api->>BS: closeTab(assets)
    alt 右栏已无 OmniMux 业务 Tab
        Api->>BS: setFocus(chat)
        Toggle-->>Toggle: hidden/disabled
    end

    User->>User: 刷新同会话
    Api->>Mem: load table(S1)
    Note over Mem,Api: 手切仍在；未碰过的 Tab 仍走默认矩阵
